// | >=       | Integer<br>Datetime         | Greater than or equal to<br>Not supported on Date custom attributes    |
// | <=       | Integer<br>Datetime         | Lower than or equal to<br>Not supported on Date custom attributes      |
// | ~        | String                               | Contains                                                                |
// | !~       | String                               | Doesn't Contain                                                         |
